  data: {
    LLM: "Form melds quickly. Don't hold high cards (K, Q, J) hoping for a meld unless you have two. Discard 10-pointers early if unmatching.\n\nThe 4-Card Limit: You can't drop a 5-card run (e.g., 3-4-5-6-7) in one go. You must drop 3-4-5-6, then add 7 next turn? No, add to existing melds later. Plan your drops.\n\nDefensive Discarding: Don't give the next player a card they need to go out. If they pick up a 7, don't throw an 8 or 6.",
    Player: "Form melds quickly. Don't hold high cards (K, Q, J) hoping for a meld unless you have two. Discard 10-pointers early if unmatching.\n\nThe 4-Card Limit: You can't drop a 5-card run (e.g., 3-4-5-6-7) in one go. You must drop 3-4-5-6, then add 7 next turn? No, add to existing melds later. Plan your drops.\n\nDefensive Discarding: Don't give the next player a card they need to go out. If they pick up a 7, don't throw an 8 or 6.",
